### FitNest Gym - Locker Room Management REST API (Group ID: YG-CSE2E-G01)
### Syllabus Coverage: Modules 1 to 5 (Use with VS Code REST Client extension)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 1: Node.js & Express Fundamentals
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Root API Health & Syllabus Info (Module 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 4: Authentication & User Management (JWT + bcrypt)
# ==============================================================================

### 2. User Registration (Module 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "trainer_anil",
  "password": "strongPassword123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### 3. User Login - Staff (Module 4: Generates JWT Token)
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "password": "staff123"
}

### Extract staff token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. User Login - Admin (Module 4: Generates Admin JWT Token)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Extract admin token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 5: Protected Routes & Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
# ==============================================================================

### 5. Access Protected Profile without Token -> Returns 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile

### 6. Access Protected Profile with Staff Token -> Returns 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 7. Access Admin Dashboard with Staff Token -> Returns 403 Forbidden (RBAC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system-status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 8. Access Admin Dashboard with Admin Token -> Returns 200 OK (RBAC Authorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/system-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 2 & 3: Lockers CRUD, Query Params & Twist 1
# ==============================================================================

### 9. Get All Active Lockers (Excludes Soft Deleted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers

### 10. Query Filter: Lockers on Floor 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers?floor=2

### 11. Create a New Locker (Module 3: Validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Locker 501",
  "floor": 5
}

### 12. Twist 1: Soft Delete Locker 12 (Sets deleted = 1)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 13. Twist 1: Verify Locker 12 is Hidden (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

### 14. Twist 1: Restore Locker 12 (Sets deleted = 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12/restore

### 15. Twist 1: Verify Locker 12 Reappeared (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lockers/12

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 2 & 3: Members CRUD
# ==============================================================================

### 16. Get All Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### 17. Create Gym Member
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Das",
  "phone": "9876543299",
  "email": "arjun@fitnest.com"
}

# ==============================================================================
# MODULE 2 & 3: Relational Allotments & Twist 2 (Status Flow)
# ==============================================================================

### 18. Create Allotment (Starts as pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 4,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 19. Prevent Duplicate Active Allotment -> Returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/allotments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_id": 5,
  "locker_id": 12
}

### 20. Relational SQL JOIN Query: Allotment Details (Module 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/allotments/details

### 21. Twist 2: Move pending -> approved (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 22. Twist 2: Backward move approved -> pending rejected (400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/allotments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}
